INVICTUS-PLACEHOLDER-PUBLIC-KEY

This file will hold the ASCII-armoured PUBLIC key that signs the [invictus]
package repo. Alex creates the key on his own machine and replaces this file
with the output of:

    gpg --armor --export <fingerprint>

Steps: docs/checklists/signing-key.md. Never put the private key here:
the package build refuses it, and gitleaks in CI flags it.
